Package: sensor-payload
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, systemd, udev, kmod, rsync, mount, util-linux, coreutils
Conflicts: argus-usb-sync
Replaces: argus-usb-sync
Recommends: python3
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: ARGUS Sensor Payload (PSDK), widget config and USB log export
 DJI Payload SDK application that reads the ARGUS sensor serial stream, logs
 it to /var/log/argus and shows live values in a DJI Pilot widget.
 Inserting a USB stick copies /var/log/argus to it (argus-usb-sync).
 Configuration is in /etc/argus.
